<div data-cmp-data-layer="{&#34;title-3c141681ed&#34;:{&#34;@type&#34;:&#34;core/wcm/components/title/v3/title&#34;,&#34;repo:modifyDate&#34;:&#34;2026-07-15T20:06:39Z&#34;,&#34;dc:title&#34;:&#34;AI doesn&#39;t slow down. Your resilience shouldn&#39;t either.&#34;}}" id="title-3c141681ed" class="cmp-title">
    <h2 class="cmp-title__text">AI doesn&#39;t slow down. Your resilience shouldn&#39;t either.</h2>
</div>

    

</div>
<div class="text text__white text__large">
<div data-cmp-data-layer="{&#34;text-58c6c63015&#34;:{&#34;@type&#34;:&#34;druvaincprogram/components/text&#34;,&#34;repo:modifyDate&#34;:&#34;2026-07-15T20:13:22Z&#34;,&#34;xdm:text&#34;:&#34;&lt;p style=\&#34;text-align: center;\&#34;>Druva preserves trusted context and data, powered by its Dru Metagraph intelligence layer. Organizations maintain operational continuity, govern data, reverse AI disruptions, and confidently leverage AI ecosystems at scale.&lt;/p>\r\n&#34;}}" id="text-58c6c63015" class="cmp-text">
    <p style="	text-align: center;
">Druva preserves trusted context and data, powered by its Dru Metagraph intelligence layer. Organizations maintain operational continuity, govern data, reverse AI disruptions, and confidently leverage AI ecosystems at scale.</p>

</div>

    

</div>
<div class="button">




  <a id="button-717629ee28" class="cmp-button   justify-center " data-cmp-clickable data-cmp-data-layer="{&#34;button-717629ee28&#34;:{&#34;@type&#34;:&#34;core/wcm/components/button/v2/button&#34;,&#34;repo:modifyDate&#34;:&#34;2026-07-15T20:08:22Z&#34;,&#34;dc:title&#34;:&#34;Explore AI Resilience&#34;,&#34;xdm:linkURL&#34;:&#34;/use-cases/ai-resilience&#34;}}" href="/use-cases/ai-resilience">
    <span class="cmp-button__text">Explore AI Resilience</span>
    
